  "description": "Abstract Pop Art Paper Digital Pack\nBold Colorful Retro Comic Scrapbook Backgrounds\n❖ Includes 12 High-Resolution Designs\n❖ Delivered in JPG Format\n❖ Dimensions: 12″ x 12″ (3600 × 3600 px)\n❖ 300 DPI for Crisp, Professional Print Quality\n❖ Features Vibrant Pop Art Patterns, Comic-Style Elements, Abstract Shapes, Halftone Dots & Bold Graphic Textures\n❖ File Size: 8–18 MB per Page\n❖ Color Palette: Bright Red, Electric Blue, Sunshine Yellow, Bold Black, Vibrant Pink\n❖ Opaque (Non-Transparent) Backgrounds\n🎨💥 Bring Bold Retro Energy to Your Projects\nThis Abstract Pop Art Paper collection captures the playful, high-contrast style of pop art with colorful patterns and comic-inspired textures. Perfect for junk journals, scrapbooking, modern crafts, posters, planner covers, ephemera sheets, and DIY stationery. Ideal for creating a fun, energetic, and eye-catching retro aesthetic.",
